{
  "$schema": "./experiment.schema.json",
  "name": "sciera-500m",
  "informative": [
    "Target topology: SCIERA, three hosts (SSH deployment), as in hummbwtester-sciera.json.",
    "",
    "+---------------+            +---------------+            +---------------+",
    "| ufes          |            | rnp           |            | ufms          |",
    "| AS 71-2:0:152 |            | AS 71-1916    |            | AS 71-2:0:5c  |",
    "| BE1 wgx-cd    |#101----#106| QoS1 wgx-ab   |#103----#104| QoS2 wgx-ab   |",
    "|    10.79.0.1  |            |    10.78.0.1  |            | BE2 wgx-cd    |",
    "|               |            |               |            | marketplace   |",
    "+---------------+            +---------------+            +---------------+",
    "",
    "#N are interface IDs. Shaped links (tc settings below): rnp - ufms (#103/#104)",
    "and rnp - ufes (#106/#101).",
    "Tunnel ab (Hummingbird): QoS1 (rnp) -> QoS2 (ufms): 71-1916#103 71-2:0:5c#104, with a",
    "reservation; copies 500 MiB of random data, verified with sha256 afterwards.",
    "Tunnel cd (best effort): BE1 (ufes) -> BE2 (ufms): 71-2:0:152#101 71-1916#106,103",
    "71-2:0:5c#104; UDP iperf3 at 10 mbps for as long as the copy runs.",
    "Both tunnels share the shaped rnp -> ufms link (#103/#104).",
    "Marketplace requests are best effort too, over 71-1916#3 71-2:0:5c#4 (br-1, not",
    "shaped), pinned by path_to_marketplace_filter so that they share no interface with the",
    "best-effort tunnel.",
    "At 5 mbps (4 mbps of payload after PAYLOAD_EFFICIENCY) the copy takes about 18 minutes.",
    "ping-cd runs from BE2 (ufms): ufes has GNU inetutils ping, without -I and -D.",
    "br-1 (the stock router, metrics on 127.0.0.1:30401) is scraped on every host with",
    "display false: stored for outage analysis, left out of the dashboard and results.json."
  ],
  "hummingbird": {
    "marketplace": {
      "host": "ufms",
      "scion_address": "[71-2:0:5c,127.0.0.1]:31888",
      "username": "alice",
      "password_env": "WGEXP_MARKETPLACE_PASSWORD",
      "location_override": true,
      "interfaces": {
        "71-1916": [
          0,
          103,
          106
        ],
        "71-2:0:152": [
          0,
          101
        ],
        "71-2:0:5c": [
          0,
          104
        ]
      }
    },
    "marketplace_insecure": true
  },
  "tunnels": [
    {
      "id": "ab",
      "mtu": 1000,
      "endpoints": [
        {
          "name": "QoS1",
          "node": "rnp",
          "isd_as": "71-1916",
          "host": "127.0.0.1",
          "listen_port": 32000,
          "tunnel_ip": "10.78.0.1",
          "api_port": 28015,
          "path_filter": "71-1916#103 71-2:0:5c#104",
          "hummingbird": {
            "bandwidth": "5mbps",
            "reverse_bandwidth": "1mbps",
            "duration": "5m",
            "renewal_ahead": "30s",
            "reservation_overlap": "20s",
            "humm_start_offset": "-5s",
            "partial": "71-1916,71-2:0:5c",
            "path_to_marketplace_filter": "71-1916#3 71-2:0:5c#4"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "QoS2",
          "node": "ufms",
          "isd_as": "71-2:0:5c",
          "host": "127.0.0.1",
          "listen_port": 32000,
          "tunnel_ip": "10.78.0.2",
          "api_port": 28015,
          "path_filter": "71-2:0:5c#104 71-1916#103"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cd",
      "mtu": 1000,
      "endpoints": [
        {
          "name": "BE1",
          "node": "ufes",
          "isd_as": "71-2:0:152",
          "host": "127.0.0.1",
          "listen_port": 32001,
          "tunnel_ip": "10.79.0.1",
          "api_port": 28016,
          "path_filter": "71-2:0:152#101 71-1916#106,103 71-2:0:5c#104"
        },
        {
          "name": "BE2",
          "node": "ufms",
          "isd_as": "71-2:0:5c",
          "host": "127.0.0.1",
          "listen_port": 32001,
          "tunnel_ip": "10.79.0.2",
          "api_port": 28016,
          "path_filter": "71-2:0:5c#104 71-1916#103,106 71-2:0:152#101"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "workloads": [
    {
      "id": "copy-500m",
      "kind": "file_copy",
      "role": "primary",
      "from": "QoS1",
      "to": "QoS2",
      "size": "500MiB",
      "verify": true,
      "bwlimit": "reservation",
      "timeout": "1h"
    },
    {
      "id": "be-load",
      "kind": "iperf3",
      "role": "background",
      "from": "BE1",
      "to": "BE2",
      "protocol": "udp",
      "bandwidth": "10mbps",
      "length": 900
    },
    {
      "id": "ping-ab",
      "kind": "ping",
      "role": "background",
      "from": "QoS1",
      "to": "QoS2",
      "interval": "200ms"
    },
    {
      "id": "ping-cd",
      "kind": "ping",
      "role": "background",
      "from": "BE2",
      "to": "BE1",
      "interval": "200ms"
    }
  ],
  "run": {
    "warmup": "60s",
    "cooldown": "60s",
    "max_duration": "2h"
  },
  "monitoring": {
    "prometheus_port": 8091,
    "grafana_port": 3001,
    "runner_metrics_port": 9189,
    "scrape_interval": "1s"
  },
  "deployment": {
    "kind": "ssh",
    "hosts": {
      "rnp": {
        "ssh": "sciera-rnp",
        "sciond": "127.0.0.1:30255",
        "run_dir": "/var/tmp/wgexp",
        "control_service": "scion-control-service-cs1.service"
      },
      "ufes": {
        "ssh": "sciera-ufes",
        "sciond": "127.0.0.1:30255",
        "run_dir": "/var/tmp/wgexp",
        "control_service": "scion-control-service-cs1.service"
      },
      "ufms": {
        "ssh": "sciera-ufms",
        "sciond": "127.0.0.1:30255",
        "run_dir": "/var/tmp/wgexp",
        "control_service": "scion-control@cs-1.service"
      }
    },
    "metrics": {
      "prometheus": "ufms",
      "local_port_base": 19190,
      "routers": [
        {
          "host": "rnp",
          "address": "127.0.0.1:38401",
          "labels": {
            "as": "71_1916",
            "br": "br-2"
          }
        },
        {
          "host": "ufes",
          "address": "127.0.0.1:38401",
          "labels": {
            "as": "71_2_0_152",
            "br": "br-2"
          }
        },
        {
          "host": "ufms",
          "address": "127.0.0.1:38401",
          "labels": {
            "as": "71_2_0_5c",
            "br": "br-2"
          }
        },
        {
          "host": "rnp",
          "address": "127.0.0.1:30401",
          "labels": {
            "as": "71_1916",
            "br": "br-1"
          },
          "display": false
        },
        {
          "host": "ufes",
          "address": "127.0.0.1:30401",
          "labels": {
            "as": "71_2_0_152",
            "br": "br-1"
          },
          "display": false
        },
        {
          "host": "ufms",
          "address": "127.0.0.1:30401",
          "labels": {
            "as": "71_2_0_5c",
            "br": "br-1"
          },
          "display": false
        }
      ]
    },
    "shaping": [
      {
        "host": "rnp",
        "name": "rnp-ufms",
        "device": "eno4.140",
        "local": "[fe80::77c:140%eno4.140]:50031",
        "remote": "[fe80::2:0:5c:140]:50031",
        "expected_root": "noqueue"
      },
      {
        "host": "ufms",
        "name": "ufms-rnp",
        "device": "ens2f1.140",
        "local": "[fe80::2:0:5c:140%ens2f1.140]:50031",
        "remote": "[fe80::77c:140]:50031",
        "expected_root": "noqueue"
      },
      {
        "host": "rnp",
        "name": "rnp-ufes",
        "device": "eno4.137",
        "local": "10.6.7.2:50001",
        "remote": "10.6.7.1:50001",
        "expected_root": "noqueue"
      },
      {
        "host": "ufes",
        "name": "ufes-rnp",
        "device": "ens192",
        "local": "10.6.7.1:50001",
        "remote": "10.6.7.2:50001",
        "expected_root": "mq"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tc": {
    "rate": "10mbit",
    "burst": "50kb",
    "limit": "256kb"
  }
}
